identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.17560655"

abstract: >
  Metadata, schemas, configuration, source code, and reproducible workflows
  for official Minnesota precinct boundaries. Boundary geometries are obtained
  directly from the Minnesota Secretary of State through the "Maps and Geodata"
  public resources (e.g., Voting Precincts Shapefiles and GeoJSON). This record
  does not redistribute any geometry data. Repository software, metadata,
  schemas, configuration, and documentation are released under the Creative
  Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0).

keywords:
  - civic data
  - geographic boundaries
  - Minnesota
  - precincts
  - reproducible research
  - open metadata
  - GIS

